{"file_id":"LANG_VOCALOID_KEYBOARD.OLANG","resource_class":"STAGEDAT_OLANG","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","shard":4,"coverage":{"first_unique_index":120,"last_unique_index":174,"row_count":55,"contiguous":true},"translations":[{"unique_index":120,"cn_text":"要输入需要发音的歌词或台词，可使用以下两种方法。\n\n1. 按英文单词输入\n用空格分隔并输入英文单词的拼写后，\n转换服务器会将英文单词解析为适当的发音。\n解析后的1个音节会分配给1个音。\n如果用带连字符的空格把一个英文单词分开，\n则每个分隔部分会被视为1个音节，并分别分配给1个音。\n对于不常用的单词，可能无法自动解析其发音，请注意。\n如果需要让非英语单词，或转换时无法自动解析的单词发音，\n请尝试下方的音素符号输入方式。\n\n2. 按音素符号输入\n输入VOCALOID音素符号，可直接指定要发出的声音。\n音素符号由[ ]内的元音与辅音组合表示，\n每组[ ]代表1个音节。\n每组[ ]中必须设置1个元音。\n此外，[ ]内各音素符号必须用空格分隔。\n如果输入了无法发音的音素符号，该部分将保持静音。\n\n输入歌词时，如果某一小节中所编写歌词的音节数\n与乐曲的音数不一致，可能不会按所写内容进行分配，请注意。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":1091,"review_flag":"JPN_HELP_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":121,"cn_text":"输入的音素符号写法有误。\n音素符号的[ ]对应关系有误。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":122,"cn_text":"输入的音素符号写法有误。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":123,"cn_text":"输入的音素符号写法有误。\n[ ]内包含不能作为音素符号使用的字符。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":124,"cn_text":"[h I@]","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":"PHONEME_EXAMPLE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":125,"cn_text":"[l0 aU d]","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":"PHONEME_EXAMPLE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":126,"cn_text":"[bh aI]","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":7,"review_flag":"PHONEME_EXAMPLE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":127,"cn_text":"[s t Q@]","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":8,"review_flag":"PHONEME_EXAMPLE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":128,"cn_text":"[V][l aI n]","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":11,"review_flag":"PHONEME_EXAMPLE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":129,"cn_text":"[ph U t]","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":8,"review_flag":"PHONEME_EXAMPLE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":130,"cn_text":"[l0 Q t]","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":8,"review_flag":"PHONEME_EXAMPLE_P